# Google Services Configuration Template

This file is intentionally not included in the repository for security reasons.

## Setup Instructions

1. **Get your google-services.json**
   - Go to [Firebase Console](https://console.firebase.google.com/)
   - Select your project
   - Go to Project Settings
   - Download the `google-services.json` file

2. **Place the file**
   - Copy `google-services.json` to `app/` directory

3. **Build and Run**
   - The app will now have Firebase connectivity

## Security Note

Never commit `google-services.json` to version control!
This file contains sensitive API keys and should be added to `.gitignore`.
